  "instructions_to_main_agent": "Build a robust full-stack College Event Management System with backend (Python FastAPI, SQLite/SQLAlchemy) and frontend (React, Tailwind CSS, Lucide icons, React Router). Implement Authentication (JWT, Admin & Student roles), Admin Dashboard with statistics, Event CRUD, Category CRUD, Student/Participant Management, Event Registration with capacity validation and date/duplicate checks, Attendance marking, Certificate generation/download, Announcements, Search/Filters, Reports, Profile management, and User Management. Ensure all interactive elements have data-testid attributes.",
